#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:5
#: e306769cd7174aa0b27183761eee140e
msgid "Maxbotix Analog Sonar"
msgstr "Maxbotix 模拟声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:7
#: 7ce674a9c94644b1b1aa60519f64d68a
msgid ""
"`XL-Maxbotix-EZ <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/xl-maxsonar-ez-"
"products/>`__ line of analog sonars (XL-MaxSonar-EZ0, EZ4 and EZL0) are "
"relatively inexpensive, short range (7m to 10m) range finder primarily "
"designed for indoor use but which has been successfully used outdoors on "
"Copter and Rover.  These are the predecessors to :ref:`I2C sonar <common-"
"rangefinder-maxbotixi2c>`."
msgstr ""
"`XL-Maxbotix-EZ <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/xl-maxsonar-ez-"
"products/>`__ 系列模拟声呐（XL-MaxSonar-EZ0、EZ4 和 EZL0）价格相对低廉，量程较短（7m 至 "
"10m），主要为室内使用设计，但也已成功用于 Copter 和 Rover 的室外环境。这些设备是 :ref:`I2C 声呐 <common-"
"rangefinder-maxbotixi2c>` 的前代产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:14
#: 1724b5c338aa40989ba7e132d4cbf3ce
msgid ""
"The `EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__ "
"(recommended) has the narrowest beam providing the best noise resistance "
"while the `EZ0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1200.htm>`__ "
"has the widest beam and higher sensitivity.  The long range `EZL0 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ has the same "
"sensitivity as the EZ0 but a 10m range (as opposed to 7m)."
msgstr ""
"`EZ4 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__（推荐）波束最窄，抗干扰性最佳；`EZ0"
" <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1200.htm>`__ 波束最宽，灵敏度最高。远程版 "
"`EZL0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ 与 EZ0 "
"灵敏度相同，但量程为 10m（而非 7m）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:22
#: 84cc2bc2344c4a17a9589d2c4ed97e9b
msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接至 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:24
#: 07d7a670c4be4d4cbf6ab82ceab2d8ff
msgid ""
"The sonar should be connected to the Pixhawk's ADC 3.3V port as shown below."
" The Pixhawk will provide the regulated 5V power supply the sonar requires."
msgstr "声呐应连接至 Pixhawk 的 ADC 3.3V 接口，如下图所示。Pixhawk 将为声呐提供所需的稳压 5V 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:32
#: 0e46a40120ce4539a85c83c7f256f0eb
msgid "Setup through the mission planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:34
#: d2798c3f185d44aea8c9fe6e168eb555
msgid ""
"please first connect with the Mission Planner and then open the "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter List page and set the following parameters "
"(example shown if first rangefinder:"
msgstr "请先连接 Mission Planner，然后打开「配置/调参 >> 完整参数列表」页面，设置以下参数（示例为第一个测距仪）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:38
#: 4d894b46be3a48e6b76d282d8d1e75eb
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = \"14\" for Pixhawk's ADC 3.3v pin #2"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = 「14」（Pixhawk ADC 3.3v 引脚 #2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:39
#: cab09fa702024367b47acf33f7b01dad
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = \"7\" (i.e. 7m max range) if using EZ0 or "
"EZ4, \"10\" if using EZL0"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 「7」（即最大量程 7m，适用于 EZ0 或 EZ4）或「10」（适用于 EZL0）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:40
#: c3f0003d1c294788986e370e0df67355
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING<RNGFND1_SCALING>` = \"2.04\" (i.e. 7m / 5v) if using "
"EZ0 or EZ4, \"4.08\" (i.e. 10m / 5v) if using EZL0"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING<RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 「2.04」（即 7m / 5v，适用于 EZ0 或 "
"EZ4）或「4.08」（即 10m / 5v，适用于 EZL0）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:41
#: 9c9343394ecf490e8a19d4d972df0a7b
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “1\" (Analog)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「1」（模拟）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:45
#: 69fd8685c63e4658bcfcad7973e39c0a
msgid ""
"The Maxbotix analogue rangefinders according to their data sheets output "
"Vcc/1024 volts per centimetre, or 0.488 v/m when supplied with 5v (which the"
" ADC 3.3v port supplies), which translates into 2.04meters per volt. The "
"range is 7.6m according to the datasheet, but analog output is limited to "
"7m. As we can only read up to 3.3v then that means 6.75m is the furthest it "
"can really measure."
msgstr ""
"根据数据手册，Maxbotix 模拟测距仪输出每厘米 Vcc/1024 伏，以 5V 供电（ADC 3.3v 接口提供）时为 0.488 "
"v/m，即每伏对应 2.04 米。数据手册标注量程为 7.6m，但模拟输出限制为 7m。由于最大只能读取到 3.3v，因此实际最大可测量距离约为 "
"6.75m。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:57
#: 4f27a7eb323a43eca2f8edb57f35329a
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:59
#: fb9e418f56614dc9b1cdd71de198f62f
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离值可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据页面的「状态」选项卡中查看，请留意「rangefinder1」项。"
